**Traits:** `ResolvesCatalogDatatableRowPermissions`, `JoinsEquipmentUsageCount`

**Scopes:** `forAuthUser()` en `Client`, `Equipment`, `Quotation`, `WorkOrder`; `visibleToUser()` en catálogo
